# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore for this Dockerfile only (build context = repo root).
# Allow-list: send only what api.Dockerfile COPYs. Keeps .env.local, .git, raw data, local venvs
# and node_modules out of the build context entirely.
*
!services/
!data/fixtures/pilot_mini/
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/tests/
